-   `Anthropic.apply` calls it. (#2092)
+   `Anthropic.Batch[value]` con `id`, `status`, `counts`, `refresh()`, `await(seconds = 30)` e
+   `outcomes()`, `Anthropic.Batch.Status` e `Anthropic.Batch.Counts`, e `Anthropic#caching` (un
